# IMPORTANT: Markdown/docs are intentionally INCLUDED in the image.
# Quantia Agent loads AGENTS.md and docs/agent/*.md at runtime and the docs
# retriever searches checked-in Markdown. Do not add broad `docs` or `*.md`
# ignore rules here.
